Package: zarowka
Title: Workflow Templates and Experimental Tools for Hyperspectral Core
    Scanning
Version: 0.1.1
Authors@R: 
    person("Maurycy", "Żarczyński", , "maurycy.zarczynski@ug.edu.pl", role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0003-2989-8152"))
Description: Scaffolding for hyperspectral core scanning projects built on
    'HSItools'. Generates ready-to-edit workflow scripts covering preview
    generation, reflectance calibration, co-registration, post-processing
    and feature extraction, and provides experimental analysis functions
    for spectral unmixing, endmember search, and signal and saturation
    screening. Functionality is proven here on real analyses before being
    promoted to 'HSItools'.
